---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const brand = (await getCollection('brand'))[0].data;
---

<BaseLayout {brand} title="Private Office — AURA Direction 05" description="Concept direction: a high-discretion private advisory brand." transparentHeader={false} bodyClass="direction direction--office">
  <section class="po-hero">
    <div class="po-hero__topline"><span>PRIVATE ADVISORY / CONCEPT 05</span><span>By invitation and referral</span></div>
    <div class="po-seal" aria-label="Private office conceptual seal"><span>PR</span><small>EST.<br/>2013</small></div>
    <div class="po-hero__copy"><p class="po-kicker">Judgment for consequential decisions</p><h1>THE <em>DECISION</em><br />DESERVES<br />A PRIVATE<br />STANDARD.</h1><p>Some work cannot be compressed into a public promise. It needs judgement, pattern recognition, and an advisor who understands what the next room will require.</p><a href="#conversation">Request a private conversation <span>↘</span></a></div>
    <figure class="po-hero__portrait"><img src="/images/portrait-story.webp" alt="Conceptual private advisor in a considered interior" width="1600" height="1000" /><figcaption>Privacy is not secrecy. It is the condition for candor.</figcaption></figure>
    <div class="po-hero__folio">VOL. 01<br />PRIVATE OFFICE<br />ADVISORY</div>
  </section>

  <section class="po-thesis"><div class="po-thesis__marker">I.</div><p>There are decisions where the additional information is not the bottleneck. <em>Discernment is.</em></p><span>The private office / a different model of access</span></section>

  <section class="po-rooms"><header><p class="po-kicker">Where this work belongs</p><h2>THREE ROOMS.<br />ONE STANDARD<br />OF JUDGMENT.</h2></header><div class="po-rooms__grid"><article><span>01</span><h3>The Boardroom</h3><p>For the decision that needs an independent read before it becomes an agenda item.</p><a href="#conversation">Board advisory ↗</a></article><article><span>02</span><h3>The Inflection</h3><p>For the moment a leader, company, or portfolio needs its next version of clarity.</p><a href="#conversation">Strategic intervention ↗</a></article><article><span>03</span><h3>The Room Within</h3><p>For the founder or executive who needs a private place to think before they perform certainty.</p><a href="#conversation">Executive counsel ↗</a></article></div></section>

  <section class="po-dossier"><div class="po-dossier__image"><img src="/images/texture-dark.webp" alt="Conceptual dark architectural texture" width="1600" height="900" /></div><div class="po-dossier__copy"><p class="po-kicker">The standard of proof</p><h2>DISCREET DOES<br />NOT MEAN<br /><em>VAGUE.</em></h2><p>The case for engaging an advisor should be clear: a defined decision, a meaningful stake, a specific scope, and an honest answer about the value of a better outcome. Confidential work can still be rigorous.</p><ul><li>Named decision context</li><li>Defined window of access</li><li>Clear advisory output</li><li>Permissioned evidence only</li></ul></div></section>

  <section class="po-notes"><div class="po-notes__heading"><p class="po-kicker">Selected notes</p><h2>WHAT CLIENTS<br />COME FOR.</h2></div><div class="po-notes__list"><article><b>01</b><div><h3>A cleaner read of the actual problem</h3><p>Before a strategy deck, a reorganization, or a public announcement makes a weak interpretation expensive.</p></div></article><article><b>02</b><div><h3>A deliberate room to think</h3><p>Not a performance review. Not an off-site full of prompts. A high-context conversation with a consequential outcome.</p></div></article><article><b>03</b><div><h3>Words that can carry a decision</h3><p>The thesis, narrative, and argument needed for the next stakeholder, board, team, or market conversation.</p></div></article></div></section>

  <section id="conversation" class="po-cta"><p class="po-kicker">A private introduction</p><h2>THE RIGHT<br />CONVERSATION<br />BEGINS <em>QUIETLY.</em></h2><p>For a defined decision, a meaningful moment, or a referral-led enquiry.</p><a href="/contact/">Request a private conversation ↗</a><span>Replies are personal. Fit is evaluated before work begins.</span></section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  :global(.direction--office) { --po-ink:#231e18; --po-paper:#f4efe4; --po-wine:#632c2d; --po-gold:#a87a35; --po-line:#bdb3a3; background:var(--po-paper); color:var(--po-ink); } :global(.direction--office .announcement-bar) { display:none; } :global(.direction--office .site-header) { background:var(--po-paper); color:var(--po-ink); border-bottom:1px solid var(--po-line); } :global(.direction--office .site-header a) { color:var(--po-ink); } :global(.direction--office .site-footer) { background:var(--po-ink); }
  .po-hero { position:relative; display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr; min-height:calc(100svh - 4.5rem); overflow:hidden; padding:0 clamp(1.25rem,4vw,4.5rem); border-bottom:1px solid var(--po-line); } .po-hero__topline { position:absolute; z-index:2; top:0; left:clamp(1.25rem,4vw,4.5rem); right:clamp(1.25rem,4vw,4.5rem); display:flex; justify-content:space-between; padding:1rem 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--po-line); color:#6b6157; font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:.58rem; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.14em; text-transform:uppercase; } .po-seal { position:absolute; z-index:2; top:4.8rem; left:clamp(1.25rem,4vw,4.5rem); display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr auto; align-items:center; gap:.4rem; width:5.8rem; height:5.8rem; padding:.4rem; border:1px solid var(--po-wine); border-radius:50%; color:var(--po-wine); } .po-seal::before { position:absolute; inset:.3rem; border:1px solid var(--po-wine); border-radius:50%; content:''; } .po-seal span { position:relative; padding-left:.5rem; font-family:var(--font-serif); font-size:1.8rem; letter-spacing:-.1em; } .po-seal small { position:relative; padding-right:.3rem; font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:.38rem; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.08em; line-height:1.2; }
  .po-hero__copy { display:grid; align-content:end; padding:clamp(10rem,18vh,13rem) clamp(1rem,4vw,5rem) clamp(4rem,8vw,7rem) 0; } .po-kicker { margin:0; color:var(--po-wine); font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:.63rem; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.14em; text-transform:uppercase; } .po-hero h1,.po-rooms h2,.po-dossier h2,.po-notes h2,.po-cta h2 { margin:1.4rem 0 0; font-family:var(--font-serif); font-size:clamp(3.7rem,7vw,8.2rem); font-weight:400; line-height:.78; letter-spacing:-.09em; } .po-hero h1 em,.po-dossier h2 em,.po-cta h2 em { color:var(--po-wine); font-style:italic; } .po-hero__copy > p:not(.po-kicker) { max-width:29rem; margin:2rem 0 0; color:#62594f; line-height:1.75; } .po-hero__copy a,.po-cta a { display:inline-block; margin-top:2rem; padding-bottom:.45rem; border-bottom:1px solid var(--po-ink); color:var(--po-ink); font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:.65rem; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.12em; text-transform:uppercase; } .po-hero__copy a:hover,.po-cta a:hover { border-color:var(--po-wine); color:var(--po-wine); } .po-hero__portrait { position:relative; margin:0 -4.5rem 0 0; background:#d4cbb9; overflow:hidden; } .po-hero__portrait img { width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; object-position:center; filter:saturate(.6) contrast(1.07); mix-blend-mode:multiply; } .po-hero__portrait figcaption { position:absolute; right:2rem; bottom:2rem; max-width:12rem; color:#f4efe4; font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:.56rem; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.11em; line-height:1.5; text-align:right; text-transform:uppercase; } .po-hero__folio { position:absolute; z-index:2; right:1.1rem; bottom:1.8rem; color:#665c51; font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:.5rem; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.13em; line-height:1.5; text-align:right; }
  .po-thesis { display:grid; grid-template-columns:.15fr 1.2fr .65fr; gap:2rem; align-items:start; padding:clamp(5rem,10vw,10rem) clamp(1.25rem,12vw,12rem); background:#e6ddcd; } .po-thesis__marker { color:var(--po-wine); font-family:var(--font-serif); font-size:3rem; font-style:italic; } .po-thesis p { max-width:17ch; margin:0; font-family:var(--font-serif); font-size:clamp(2.2rem,4.6vw,5rem); line-height:.98; letter-spacing:-.06em; } .po-thesis p em { color:var(--po-wine); } .po-thesis > span { align-self:end; color:#675d52; font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:.58rem; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.14em; line-height:1.5; text-transform:uppercase; }
  .po-rooms { padding:clamp(5rem,10vw,10rem) clamp(1.25rem,6vw,7rem); } .po-rooms h2 { max-width:11ch; font-size:clamp(3rem,5.9vw,6.6rem); } .po-rooms__grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:1px; margin-top:clamp(3rem,6vw,6rem); border:1px solid var(--po-line); background:var(--po-line); } .po-rooms__grid article { display:flex; min-height:22rem; flex-direction:column; padding:1.5rem; background:var(--po-paper); } .po-rooms__grid span { color:var(--po-wine); font-family:var(--font-serif); font-size:1.5rem; font-style:italic; } .po-rooms__grid h3 { margin:clamp(4.5rem,8vw,8rem) 0 0; font-family:var(--font-serif); font-size:2.6rem; font-weight:400; letter-spacing:-.06em; line-height:.95; } .po-rooms__grid p { max-width:17rem; margin:1rem 0 0; color:#62594f; line-height:1.65; } .po-rooms__grid a { margin-top:auto; color:var(--po-wine); font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:.6rem; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.12em; text-transform:uppercase; }
  .po-dossier { display:grid; grid-template-columns:.85fr 1.15fr; min-height:40rem; background:var(--po-ink); color:var(--po-paper); } .po-dossier__image { overflow:hidden; background:var(--po-wine); } .po-dossier__image img { width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; mix-blend-mode:screen; opacity:.6; } .po-dossier__copy { padding:clamp(4rem,9vw,10rem); } .po-dossier .po-kicker { color:#d5af69; } .po-dossier h2 { font-size:clamp(2.8rem,5.5vw,6rem); } .po-dossier h2 em { color:#d5af69; } .po-dossier__copy > p:not(.po-kicker) { max-width:33rem; margin:2rem 0 0; color:#d4cdc0; line-height:1.75; } .po-dossier ul { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); gap:.6rem; margin:3rem 0 0; padding:0; list-style:none; border-top:1px solid rgba(244,239,228,.3); } .po-dossier li { padding-top:.8rem; color:#e3dbc9; font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:.6rem; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.1em; text-transform:uppercase; }
  .po-notes { display:grid; grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr; gap:clamp(3rem,9vw,10rem); padding:clamp(5rem,10vw,10rem) clamp(1.25rem,7vw,8rem); } .po-notes h2 { font-size:clamp(3rem,5.5vw,6rem); } .po-notes__list { border-top:1px solid var(--po-line); } .po-notes__list article { display:grid; grid-template-columns:3rem 1fr; gap:1rem; padding:1.5rem 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--po-line); } .po-notes__list b { color:var(--po-wine); font-family:var(--font-serif); font-size:1.7rem; font-weight:400; font-style:italic; } .po-notes__list h3 { margin:0; font-family:var(--font-serif); font-size:1.9rem; font-weight:400; letter-spacing:-.04em; } .po-notes__list p { margin:.6rem 0 0; color:#62594f; line-height:1.65; }
  .po-cta { padding:clamp(5rem,10vw,10rem) 1.5rem; background:var(--po-wine); color:var(--po-paper); text-align:center; } .po-cta .po-kicker { color:#e6c886; } .po-cta h2 { font-size:clamp(3.2rem,7vw,8rem); } .po-cta h2 em { color:#e6c886; } .po-cta > p:not(.po-kicker) { margin:1.4rem auto 0; color:#eaded0; } .po-cta a { color:var(--po-paper); border-color:var(--po-paper); } .po-cta > span { display:block; margin-top:1.4rem; color:#e1cbbb; font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:.55rem; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.12em; text-transform:uppercase; }
  @media (max-width:760px) { .po-hero { grid-template-columns:1fr; min-height:auto; padding:0 1.25rem; } .po-hero__copy { padding:9rem 0 3rem; } .po-hero__portrait { min-height:26rem; margin:0 -1.25rem; } .po-hero__folio { display:none; } .po-thesis,.po-notes { grid-template-columns:1fr; } .po-thesis__marker { display:none; } .po-rooms__grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; } .po-dossier { grid-template-columns:1fr; } .po-dossier__image { min-height:21rem; } }
</style>
